es remain read-only.; ADR0083: if a newly added Trogr dies within the same confirmation, that outcome is proven by the actual composition prefix; no new SYM-076 stat/reached/included/legacy fact, prior ledger unchanged or absent, independent absorption/duel/SYM-079 facts retained.; ADR0084 custom item closure: closed CATALOG_ITEM FK or campaign-bound CAMPAIGN_CUSTOM_PROFILE identity; explicit structured fields and NONE or one positive integer stat bonus; quantity=1 for each bonus instance; actual same-owner backpack or explicit outside state; immutable profile/version/provenance and separate source-derived item layer; no invented catalogue IDs, containers, defaults or replaced canonical mechanics.; ADR0085 initial life closure: explicit ALIVE/SEVERELY_WOUNDED/DEAD and reason with matching HP; severe state has one actual host D6, explicit exact remaining minutes and independently proven original/current duplicate and time binding; retained timers never restart, terminal death never revives by ordinary edit; no synthetic damage, repeated protections or self-proven historical origins.; ADR0086 temporary Weaver closure: only explicit source-bound formal TEMPORARY/RECOVERY/PROTECTION with reason, exact remaining within 5/7/10 and actual time; original R20 ABSENT and no activation/resource replay; final life/HP/source/cardinality valid, recovery deadline fits unchanged death deadline, retained origins immutable and expired unresolved source blocks current snapshot.; ADR0087 poison closure: every new actual Taipan has an explicit learned initial mode, retained mode/pending timer remain independently proven; new prepared dose matches actual active source mode, physical carrier and confirmed time, with closed identities and original/current-or-last-proven source contexts; no target dice, fake expiry, free mode switch, duplicate dose or self-proven history. Выполнить J-NPC-CREATE через формы NPC-001, NPC-003, NPC-007, NPC-008, NPC-009, NPC-010; использовать только primaryActions каждой actionSteps-записи и команды UI-CMD-NPC-ARCHIVE, UI-CMD-NPC-DELETE, UI-CMD-NPC-DUPLICATE, UI-CMD-NPC-NEW-VERSION; проверить перечисленные terminalStatesByForm и ровно один audit/receipt на mutation boundary. Owner decision #186 C: the host-bound technical attempt carries campaignId, npcDraftId, attemptRevision and editMode=CREATE_V1|APPEND_N_PLUS_ONE. APPEND_N_PLUS_ONE additionally binds npcUuid and expectedCurrentVersion to the selected current snapshot. The client cannot select or change this mode/binding. All eight wizard stages preserve it; cancel before final commit creates no NPC version or history entry. Sole current authenticated campaign GM; persistent non-archived NPC; current campaign/npcUuid and expectedCurrentVersion match. UI-CMD-NPC-NEW-VERSION phase=OPEN is allowed only from NPC-003/NPC-007 and creates only a bound full-edit attempt from the current snapshot, without changing NPC/currentVersion/history; active combat retains its pinned prior snapshot. Sole current authenticated campaign GM; UI-CMD-NPC-NEW-VERSION phase=COMMIT only from NPC-017 with host-bound APPEND_N_PLUS_ONE attempt; expectedCurrentVersion and attemptRevision are current; all eight stages, sex/race/mass and resolved art validate. Atomically append the full N+1 snapshot/history to the same npcUuid; prior versions and combat pins remain unchanged. COMMIT only: При pre-Start calendar state подтверждены initial time и свежий host-bound PRE_START_INITIAL preview; после Start проверяется CURRENT_CAMPAIGN preview. Без календарного состояния time binding не требуется. Stale time/attempt/campaign revision causes zero write. COMMIT only: Initial trauma authoring is closed and source-valid: one explicit choice per host-bound trauma identity; final entered HP is preserved for TORSO; HEAD penalty=PENDING|CONSUMED and stun=ABSENT|ACTIVE are explicit. ACTIVE requires traumaValue>6, a canonical decimal-string remainingMinutes with exact rational 0<r<=5 and a current typed calendar bindi