даёт fake damage/death event, combat, turn или organId. Таймер при создании не тикает. Последующие настоящие события сохраняют CORE-152–156/182. PREPARED связывает реальный preparation ID без будущего COMMIT; COMMITTED — фактический owning COMMIT/version/time. Host проверяет исходные операции и независимую history, snapshot reference не служит собственным доказательством. Exact replay/restart возвращает прежние receipt/IDs/D6; stale/foreign/changed request не пишет ничего. Старые snapshots, FINAL, receipts и отсутствие полей не переписываются. ADR0086 retained state: N+1 без изменения сохраняет точные original effect ID/COMMIT/T/deadline/branch. Same identity не получает новый срок. Явное снятие требует отдельной причины; повторное formal назначение создаёт новый source operation/effect identity и не меняет старую запись, не даёт автоматически нового life D6 и не продлевает original death deadline. Если actual source удалён, отключён или лишён нужного изученного узла, сохранение эффекта в новой версии блокируется до явного снятия несовместимого состояния. Это authoring guard, не новое общее played-source termination правило. ADR0086 origin/replay: source — реальная immutable NPC-016 operation; PREPARED и original COMMIT различаются. Candidate хранит только refs, host независимо восстанавливает owning operation и original COMMIT; current composition/clock повторно проверяются на COMMIT. Stale/foreign/changed request даёт zero write, exact replay прежний receipt. Historical snapshots читаются со своим original context и не переписываются; прежние FINAL/receipts и отсутствие полей неизменны.",
+        "guards": "Host-bound editMode=CREATE_V1; Все восемь обязательных этапов валидны; sex, raceCode и massKg прошли включительные границы #113 при шаге 0.1kg; resolvedArtAssetKey определён; UUID ещё не зафиксирован; revision актуальна. При pre-Start calendar state подтверждены initial time и свежий host-bound PRE_START_INITIAL preview; после Start проверяется CURRENT_CAMPAIGN preview. Без календарного состояния time binding не требуется. Stale time/attempt/campaign revision causes zero write. Initial trauma authoring is closed and source-valid: one explicit choice per host-bound trauma identity; final entered HP is preserved for TORSO; HEAD penalty=PENDING|CONSUMED and stun=ABSENT|ACTIVE are explicit. ACTIVE requires traumaValue>6, a canonical decimal-string remainingMinutes with exact rational 0<r<=5 and a current typed calendar binding; ABSENT has no timer fields. Retained identities keep original committed facts/anchors. No played damage/RNG event or repeated one-time consequence is synthesized; incomplete/stale/foreign/changed input refuses with zero writes. ADR0082 composition closure: actual source-bound Trogr strength/included-strength/signed-snapshot facts and immutable history are complete; current symbiont source and SYM-166 capacity are recomputed, not client asserted. ADR0082 skill closure: every charge names START, TRAINING or SYM-166; SYM-166 has current capacity5/0 with retained costs and explicit overfill, no repeated grant or rewriting original pools. ADR0082 initial-state closure: CORE-110 uses exact startsAt+60 schedule or proven NO_EFFECT; combined MON-023/SYM-034 HP uses exact1000 precedence and proven source/time state without replaying activation/expiry consequences. ADR0082 source closure: immutable old snapshots/FINAL/receipts/IDs/timestamps and exact proof prefixes are retained; new facts bind to actual owner/attempt/version/campaign/time and source instances. Unknown, missing, foreign, stale, changed or unproven historical data refuses with zero writes. No invented histories/RNG, unchecked numerical fields or second NPC shell; all new editable choices have actual controls, computed values remain read-only. ADR0083: if a newly added Trogr dies within the same confirmation, that outcome is proven by the actual composition prefix; no new SYM-076 stat/reached/included/legacy fact, prior ledger unchanged or absent, independent absorption/duel/SYM-079 facts retained. ADR0084 custom item closure: closed CATALOG_ITEM FK or campaign-bound CAMPAIGN_CUSTOM_PROFILE identity; explicit structured fields and NONE or one positive integer stat bonus; quantity=1 for each bonus instance; actual same-owner backpack or explicit outside state; immutable profile/version/provenance and separate source-derived item layer; no invented catalogue IDs, containers, defaults or replaced canonical mechanics. ADR0085 initial life closure: explicit ALIVE/SEVERELY_WOUNDED/DEAD and reason with matching HP; severe state has one actual host D6, explicit exact remaining minutes and independently proven original/current duplicate and time binding; retained timers never restart, terminal death never revives by ordinary edit; no synthetic damage, repeated protections or self-proven historical origins. ADR0086 temporary Weaver closure: only explicit source-bound formal TEMPORARY/RECOVERY/PROTECTION with reason, exact remaining within 5/7/10 and actual time; original R20 ABSENT and no activation/resource replay; final life/HP/source/cardinality valid, recovery deadline fits unchanged death deadline, retained origins immutable and expired unresolved source blocks current snapshot. ADR0087 poison closure: every new actual Taipan has an explicit learned initial mode, retained mode/pending timer remain independently proven; new prepared dose matches actual active source mode, physical carrier and confirmed time, with closed identities and original/current-or-last-proven source contexts; no target dice, fake expiry, free mode switch, duplicate